# include-package-ref root
library "Root".
include "SomePkg".

// Explicit include of a multi-layer PACKAGE + a cross-lib ref into it. The
// package is never split in this consumer, so the guard must NOT fire and
// `include SomePkg` in Root.cql resolves to the package's own CQL (not dangling).
concept "Root C":
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- defined as "SomePkg"."Pkg C".
